#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:78
msgid ""
"Each input corresponds to an incoming number connection, or a <<constant-"
"input,constant>>. The result is propogated to the output after 1 tick."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:80
msgid ""
"Numbers are 64-bit floating point values. They can represent fractional "
"values, but their precision is limited. Slight rounding may occur during "
"calculation. Integers outside the range ±2^53^ may not be exact. Dividing a "
"non-zero number by 0 results in ∞ or -∞."
msgstr ""

