"An arithmetic tube can also be connected to other components via redstone "
"connections, such as with xref:electron-tube.adoc[logical tubes] and "
"xref:redstone-link.adoc[redstone links]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:144
#, no-wrap
msgid "Redstone Input"
msgstr ""

#. type: #redstone-input
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:147
msgid ""
"When connected by redstone as a sink, the behaviour of the arithmetic tube "
"when powered by redstone can be configured."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:148
#, no-wrap
msgid "Settings with an incoming redstone connection"
msgstr ""

#. type: #redstone-input
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:152
msgid "2 options can be selected by scrolling on ❶:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:153
#, no-wrap
msgid "Override"
msgstr ""

#. type: #redstone-input
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:155
msgid ""
"When powered by redstone, override the output to the number specified in ❷."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:156
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hold"
msgstr ""

#. type: #redstone-input
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:158
