msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:160
#, no-wrap
msgid "Redstone Output"
msgstr ""

#. type: #redstone-output
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:163
msgid ""
"When connected by redstone as a source, the arithmetic tube can be "
"configured to compare the numerical result with a constant, and output a "
"redstone signal when the comparison is satisfied."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:164
#, no-wrap
msgid "Settings with an outgoing redstone connection"
msgstr ""

#. type: #redstone-output
#: ../src/arithmetic-tube.adoc:167
msgid ""
"Scroll on ❶ to select a comparator (>, <, =, ≥, ≤, ≠), click ❷ to enter the "
"number to compare to."
msgstr ""
